{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 10: the rookie and veteran chain with coflows of experience in each stage, and the same workforce as one stock with one coflow. The aggregate coflow assumes that leavers take the average experience with them. Starts in balance. }
Base Hiring=
	1.24
	~	person/month
	~	Hiring that replaces leavers: 1 veteran and 0.24 rookies a month.
	|
Push Size=
	20
	~	person/month
	~	Extra hiring rate during the push.
	|
Push Start=
	6
	~	month
	~	|
Push Duration=
	3
	~	month
	~	Twenty extra a month for three months: 60 extra hires, a 60% expansion.
	|
Hiring=
	Base Hiring + Push Size * PULSE(Push Start, Push Duration)
	~	person/month
	~	|
Rookies= INTEG(
	Hiring - Assimilation - Rookie Quits,
	6)
	~	person
	~	New people still learning the job.
	|
Assimilation Time=
	6
	~	month
	~	Average time for a rookie to become fully productive.
	|
Assimilation=
	Rookies / Assimilation Time
	~	person/month
	~	|
Rookie Quit Fraction=
	0.04
	~	1/month
	~	Rookies leave four times as often as veterans.
	|
Rookie Quits=
	Rookies * Rookie Quit Fraction
	~	person/month
	~	|
Veterans= INTEG(
	Assimilation - Veteran Quits,
	100)
	~	person
	~	Fully productive people.
	|
Veteran Quit Fraction=
	0.01
	~	1/month
	~	Average veteran tenure 100 months.
	|
Veteran Quits=
	Veterans * Veteran Quit Fraction
	~	person/month
	~	|
Experience of Hires=
	12
	~	month
	~	Average prior experience of a new hire.
	|
Experience Gain=
	1
	~	dmnl
	~	Each person gains one month of experience per month.
	|
Rookie Experience= INTEG(
	Experience Hired + Experience Gained by Rookies - Experience Promoted - Experience Lost by Rookies,
	101.032)
	~	person*month
	~	Total experience held by rookies.
	|
Experience Hired=
	Hiring * Experience of Hires
	~	person
	~	Experience brought in by hires (person-months per month).
	|
Experience Gained by Rookies=
	Rookies * Experience Gain
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Promoted=
	Assimilation * Average Rookie Experience
	~	person
	~	Experience carried by rookies who become veterans.
	|
Experience Lost by Rookies=
	Rookie Quits * Average Rookie Experience
	~	person
	~	|
Average Rookie Experience=
	ZIDZ(Rookie Experience, Rookies)
	~	month
	~	|
Veteran Experience= INTEG(
	Experience Promoted + Experience Gained by Veterans - Experience Lost by Veterans,
	11683.87)
	~	person*month
	~	Total experience held by veterans.
	|
Experience Gained by Veterans=
	Veterans * Experience Gain
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Lost by Veterans=
	Veteran Quits * Average Veteran Experience
	~	person
	~	|
Average Veteran Experience=
	ZIDZ(Veteran Experience, Veterans)
	~	month
	~	|
Chain Average Experience=
	ZIDZ(Rookie Experience + Veteran Experience, Rookies + Veterans)
	~	month
	~	Average experience when each stage keeps its own coflow.
	|
Staff= INTEG(
	Staff Hiring - Staff Quits,
	106)
	~	person
	~	The same workforce as one stock.
	|
Staff Hiring=
	Hiring
	~	person/month
	~	|
Staff Quits=
	Rookie Quits + Veteran Quits
	~	person/month
	~	The same leavers as in the chain.
	|
Total Experience= INTEG(
	Experience Hired Aggregate + Experience Gained Aggregate - Experience Lost Aggregate,
	10333.29)
	~	person*month
	~	One coflow for the whole workforce.
	|
Experience Hired Aggregate=
	Staff Hiring * Experience of Hires
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Gained Aggregate=
	Staff * Experience Gain
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Lost Aggregate=
	Staff Quits * Aggregate Average Experience
	~	person
	~	Leavers take the average experience with them: the mixing assumption.
	|
Aggregate Average Experience=
	ZIDZ(Total Experience, Staff)
	~	month
	~	Average experience of the workforce as one stock.
	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ month ~ |
FINAL TIME = 60 ~ month ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
